---

Finding the right CRM can be the difference between a chaotic lead pile and a predictable pipeline. We tested **12 platforms** across three months, evaluating lead capture, automation depth, mobile experience, and total cost of ownership for a team of five agents.

The real estate CRM market has matured significantly — most tools now offer some form of AI-assisted follow-up and SMS automation. The differentiators are in the details: how cleanly leads flow in from Zillow and Realtor.com, how easy it is to hand off a lead to a showing agent, and how well the mobile app holds up in the field.
